# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Env files and their timestamped backups. Note that `.env*.local` does NOT
# match `.env.local.bak-2026…`: the pattern requires the name to END in
# `.local`, and editing env files routinely leaves such copies behind holding
# the same keys as the original.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.*.example
.env*.bak*
.env.*.bak*

# Service accounts, certificates and private keys.
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
